<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES UNCHANGED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    June 19 fix	  June 18 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.07 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.21 pct		3.21 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.34 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.47 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
